    <mxGraphModel dx="1233" dy="695" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="d3V86LnB9oLFMA-N6rPh-1" value="User Stories for CarSharing App:&lt;br&gt;1. User should be able to register/sign in to the application&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2. As an Admin user should be able to update its profile&lt;br&gt;3. As an Admin user should be able to add/remove/update cars for the rental&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;4. As an Admin user should be able to see all the rentals being made&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;5. As an Admin user should be able to see all the transactions being made&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;6. As a Regular account user should be able to rent cars&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;7. As a Regular account user should be able to release cars&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;8. As a Regular account user should be able to top up his account&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="240" width="460" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
